      "statement": "DFS-2010-09 is effective 2010-09-01 and is superseded by DFS-2016-02 for policies effective on or after 2016-02-22, while remaining in force for policies written under the earlier position; DFS-2016-02 is effective 2016-02-22 and applies prospectively.",
