      "statement": "Under the historical DFS-2010-09 position, nonrenewal notice was due at least 45 days before the policy end date and cancellation for a reason other than nonpayment was due at least 20 days before the cancellation effective date; the bulletin also required specific written reasons, delivery evidence, supporting records, and filing and approval of notice forms before use.",
