      "id": "claim_e749960ccde743ae92d1756305f3dc24",
      "statement": "For cancellation or nonrenewal based on claims information, DFS-2016-02 requires written standards and relevant, accurate, verified claims information, distinguishes claims from inquiries, requires a specific claim-related notice reason, and requires investigation and correction when the insured disputes inaccurate information.",
