    {
      "id": "claim_bc82f51feebf4678abde8e425aa6d0ef",
      "statement": "HO 01 31 applies a separate windstorm and hail deductible of no less than 1% and no more than 5% to covered direct physical loss, uses one such deductible for related damage from one occurrence, permits separate deductibles for separate occurrences, and applies the deductible only after coverage limitations to covered loss.",
