      "id": "claim_79e5a516b1f44694b4ae0abbb0a6cbd3",
      "statement": "HO 01 31 requires written deductible-change notice identifying the new deductible, affected coverage, and circumstances, permits application only to losses after the notice's effective date, supplies no numeric advance period, and does not permit an oral statement to change the deductible; its named-storm period is a fact-based investigation mechanism rather than an automatic coverage or deductible trigger.",
      "evidence": [
