      "statement": "HO 01 31 requires claim acknowledgment within 15 days, acceptance or rejection within 15 business days after requested information and documents are received, payment of an accepted claim within 5 business days, and suit within 2 years after the date of loss; it also requires prompt notice, cooperation, protection and preservation of property, evidence and records, examination under oath when requested, and preservation of recovery rights.",
